  "Info": {
    "eyebrow": "About the Firm",
    "title": "A quiet legacy of <highlight>trust</highlight> and defence.",
    "p1": "We began in a two-room office in Putalisadak in 1998, taking on cases nobody else wanted to touch. Twenty-five years later, our doors are wider — but the instinct is the same. We work carefully, we say what we mean, and we do not take a matter we cannot honestly serve.",
    "p2": "Our advocates appear regularly before the Supreme Court and the High Courts across Nepal, and advise clients from single-founder startups to listed companies. Every engagement is led by a partner. Not a \"team\". A person, whose name you will know.",
    "p3": "We are proud of the work. We are prouder of the clients who keep coming back — often years apart, with a very different problem, but the same one question: <em>what would you do, if this were you?</em>",
